Origin

Large parts of this library are a port to Java of go-xslt, a pure Go XSLT 3.0 /
XPath 3.1 / XSD engine:

  go-xslt, Copyright 2026 Tim Riep, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  https://github.com/tim-riep/go-xslt

The Go sources were used as the reference for architecture and behaviour. The
port was written and changed by Philip Helger.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components

Runtime dependencies are resolved by Maven. The W3C conformance test suites
(qt3tests, xslt30-test, xsdtests) are used for testing only, are cloned
separately, and are not part of this repository or its artifacts.

